# .gitignore — AtlasCore
#
# FOSS boundary is CODE, not DATA. Never commit harvested data, raw payloads,
# secrets, private endpoints, or personal data. The raw store, .env, and local
# DBs are excluded here; the secrets posture is .env-only (gitignored), with an
# OPTIONAL committed SOPS file (secrets.sops.yaml) whose key lives OUTSIDE the
# repo — that one file is explicitly NOT ignored (see the secrets section below).

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
*.egg
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# --- Virtual environments -------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# --- Packaging / build artifacts ------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
wheels/
*.whl
*.tar.gz

# --- Tooling caches -------------------------------------------------------
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.dmypy.json
dmypy.json
.cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml

# --- Secrets & environment (NEVER commit real secrets) --------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
# detect-secrets baseline is committed; the key file for SOPS/age is NOT.
key.txt
age.key
*.agekey
# The OPTIONAL encrypted secrets file MAY be committed; its decrypt key lives
# outside the repo (password manager / hardware key). Do not ignore it:
!secrets.sops.yaml

# --- Local databases / data dumps -----------------------------------------
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sql
*.dump
*.bak

# --- Raw store (immutable, content-addressed payloads on local disk) ------
# Matches RAW_STORE_DIR default in .env.example. NEVER commit raw payloads.
/rawstore/
/var/rawstore/
data/raw/

# --- Backups (pg_dump + raw sync; offsite, never in the repo) -------------
/backups/
*.pgdump

# --- OS / editor cruft ----------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
